{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage an illegal business, get rid of undercover cops with the mafia\u2019s help, and ultimately buy your apartment to become fully independent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TOMATO IS BANNED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tomatoes are <strong>illegal</strong> globally. But, just like most of the plants, it can be grown easily on most places, like a balcony. You are working on a tomato shop. Daily,</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow tomato <strong>plants</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk with plants to improve productivity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dump spoiled tomatoes to decrease spreading <strong>smell</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dry harvested tomatoes to sell</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tomatoes <strong>smell </strong>and the lady living across the hall seems like an retired cop. So, be careful when opening apartment door.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shop is near an university and most of the customers are students. But, there are some undercover policeman hidden as students as well. At least, they follow rules. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you open the shop, mafia gives information about their current rules and trends. They can be deducted from regular customers when you know their patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you detect an undercover cop and notify mafia, they <strong>take care</strong> of them.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAFIA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help is not free. you need to pay protection money to mafia.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3914400?t=1769100693","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3914400?t=1769100693","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914400/f5277efb6ad30b387fd489801325d7fa3179a434/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769100693","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914400/f5277efb6ad30b387fd489801325d7fa3179a434/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769100693","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Even though tomatoes are legal, in the game it is banned. So, growing or selling those can be perceived as \"dealing\"."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage an illegal business, get rid of undercover cops with the mafia\u2019s help, and ultimately buy your apartment to become fully independent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TOMATO IS BANNED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tomatoes are <strong>illegal</strong> globally. But, just like most of the plants, it can be grown easily on most places, like a balcony. You are working on a tomato shop. Daily,</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow tomato <strong>plants</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk with plants to improve productivity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dump spoiled tomatoes to decrease spreading <strong>smell</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dry harvested tomatoes to sell</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tomatoes <strong>smell </strong>and the lady living across the hall seems like an retired cop. So, be careful when opening apartment door.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shop is near an university and most of the customers are students. But, there are some undercover policeman hidden as students as well. At least, they follow rules. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you open the shop, mafia gives information about their current rules and trends. They can be deducted from regular customers when you know their patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you detect an undercover cop and notify mafia, they <strong>take care</strong> of them.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAFIA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help is not free. you need to pay protection money to mafia.</p>","developers":["Burak Akdemir"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914400/ed4f5dce18eddb8a620f72e927d917baede5981a/header.jpg?t=1769100693","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3914400/538342329/922a747e3ac9e54b17007bb2873c412897edde9a/1769096038/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769100692","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3914400/538342329/922a747e3ac9e54b17007bb2873c412897edde9a/1769096038/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769100692","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3914400/538342329/922a747e3ac9e54b17007bb2873c412897edde9a/1769096038/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769100692","id":257176401,"name":"Tomato Dealer - First Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257176401/d9616344d291bd7dfb7610240a8dfa63244ae42a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1769100692"}],"name":"Tomato Dealer","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-10400F<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 420 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>